From: jason-liu-4980 <38558962+jason-liu-4980@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 06:09:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] net: wwan: integrate UDX710 SIPC ports and SIPA data
 links

Expose bounded SBUF AT streams and SIPA links through WWAN. Bind
opened streams to their communication session and keep supplier
dependencies explicit. Remove unused SIPX and delegator paths.
